3:07.592">ka</span><span begin="3:07.592" end="3:08.094">ra</span></text><text for="L42"><span begin="3:08.428" end="3:08.611">do</span><span begin="3:08.611" end="3:08.764">n</span><span begin="3:08.764" end="3:08.875">na</span><span begin="3:08.875" end="3:08.945">fu</span><span begin="3:08.945" end="3:09.971">a n</span><span begin="3:09.971" end="3:10.248">sa</span><span begin="3:10.248" end="3:10.758">e</span></text><text for="L43"><span begin="3:11.065" end="3:11.377">ke</span><span begin="3:11.377" end="3:11.740">chi</span><span begin="3:11.740" end="3:11.954">ra</span><span begin="3:11.954" end="3:12.071">su</span><span begin="3:12.071" end="3:12.265">yo</span><span begin="3:12.265" end="3:12.545">u</span><span begin="3:12.545" end="3:12.825">na</span><span begin="3:12.929" end="3:13.253">a i</span><span begin="3:13.253" end="3:13.332">wa</span><span begin="3:13.332" end="3:13.760">sho u</span><span begin="3:13.760" end="3:14.221">do u</span></text><text for="L44"><span begin="3:14.411" end="3:14.553">i</span><span begin="3:14.553" end="3:14.761">tsu</span><span begin="3:14.761" end="3:14.921">ka</span><span begin="3:14.921" end="3:15.079">mi</span><span begin="3:15.079" end="3:15.279">ta</span><span begin="3:15.364" end="3:15.748">yu me</span><span begin="3:15.748" end="3:15.865">no</span><span begin="3:15.865" end="3:16.089">ha</span><span begin="3:16.089" end="3:16.381">te</span></text><text for="L45"><span begin="3:16.533" end="3:16.748">so</span><span begin="3:16.748" end="3:16.929">no</span><span begin="3:16.929" end="3:17.073">mo</span><span begin="3:17.073" end="3:17.418">t</span><span begin="3:17.418" end="3:17.578">to</span><span begin="3:17.578" end="3:17.787">to o</span><span begin="3:17.787" end="3:17.913">ku</span><span begin="3:17.913" end="3:18.234">ma</span><span begin="3:18.234" end="3:18.911">de</span></text><text for="L46"><span begin="3:19.088" end="3:19.433">pa a</span><span begin="3:19.433" end="3:19.736">te i i</span><span begin="3:19.736" end="3:20.054">wo</span><span begin="3:20.054" end="3:20.734">tsu zu</span><span begin="3:20.734" end="3:20.922">ke</span><span begin="3:20.922" end="3:21.066">yo</span><span begin="3:21.066" end="3:21.385">u</span></text><text for="L47"><span begin="3:21.667" end="3:22.074">su</span><span begin="3:22.074" end="3:22.416">ki</span><span begin="3:22.416" end="3:22.742">mo</span><span begin="3:22.742" end="3:23.397">ki ra</span><span begin="3:23.397" end="3:23.596">i</span><span begin="3:23.596" end="3:23.945">mo</span><span begin="3:23.945" end="3:24.375">ko</span><span begin="3:24.375" end="3:24.754">e</span><span begin="3:24.754" end="3:27.655">te</span></text></transliteration></transliterations><songwriters><songwriter>sabio</songwriter></songwriters></iTunesMetadata></metadata></head><body dur="3:27.655"><div begin="1.672" end="3:27.655"><p begin="1.672" end="7.029" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">果</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1.672" end="2.045">は</span></span></span><span begin="2.045" end="2.235">て</span><span begin="2.235" end="3.070">し</span><span begin="3.070" end="3.716">な</span><span begin="3.716" end="4.156">く</span><span tts:ruby="container" amll:empty-beat="1"><span tts:ruby="base">呪</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="4.403" end="4.766">の</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="4.766" end="5.079">ろ</span></span></span><span begin="5.079" end="5.567">え</span><span begin="5.567" end="5.941">て</span><span begin="5.941" end="6.376">し</span><span begin="6.376" end="6.823">ま</span><span begin="6.823" end="7.029">う</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">无尽的、应当诅咒的世界里</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">讓人不禁想無盡咒罵</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">In a world I could curse endlessly</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">В мире, где можно бесконечно проклинать судьбу,</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt-BR">Num mundo em que se pode amaldiçoar sem fim</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">In questo mondo che maledirei all&apos;infinito</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Dans un monde que je pourrais maudire sans fin</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">In einer Welt, die ich endlos verfluchen könnte</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es-419">El mundo que maldigo sin parar</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es-ES">Al que podría maldecir eternamente</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ar">يمكنني أن ألعن بلا حدود</span></p><p begin="7.380" end="12.091" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="7.380" end="7.732">こ</span><span begin="7.732" end="7.936">の</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">世</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="7.936" end="8.376">せ</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container" amll:empty-beat="1"><span tts:ruby="base">界</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="8.376" end="8.754">か</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="8.754" end="9.072">い</span></span></span><span begin="9.072" end="9.408">で</span><span tts:ruby="container" amll:empty-beat="1"><span tts:ruby="base">君</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="9.724" end="10.064">き</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="10.064" end="10.395">み</span></span></span><span begin="10.395" end="10.908">と</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">出</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="10.908" end="11.095">で</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">逢</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="11.095" end="11.438">あ</span></span></span><span begin="11.438" end="11.726">っ</span><span begin="11.726" end="12.091">た</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我与你相遇了</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">身在如此世界 卻遇見了你</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">I found you</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">я встретила тебя.</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt-BR">Eu te encontrei</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Ho incontrato te</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Je t&apos;ai trouvée</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Habe ich dich gefunden</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es-419">Fue testigo de nuestro encuentro</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es-ES">Te encontré en este mundo</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ar">التقيت بك في هذا العالم</span></p><p begin="12.397" end="17.465" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container" amll:empty-beat="1"><span tts:ruby="base">同</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="12.397" end="12.746">お</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="12.746" end="13.034">な</span></span></span><span begin="13.034" end="13.568">じ</span><span tts:ruby="container" amll:empty-beat="1"><span tts:ruby="base">色</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="13.759" end="14.091">い</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="14.091" end="14.422">ろ</span></span></span><span begin="14.422" end="14.697">の</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">血</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="14.697" end="15.051">ち</span></span></span><span begin="15.051" end="15.400">が</span><span tts:ruby="container" amll:empty-beat="1"><span tts:ruby="base">流</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="15.400" end="15.725">な</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="15.725" end="16.089">が</span></span></span><span begin="16.089" end="16.425">れ</span><span begin="16.425" end="16.746">て</span><span begin="16.746" end="17.078">い</span><span begin="17.078" end="17.465">る</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">体内流淌着同色的血液</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">我們流淌著同樣血液</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">The same blood runs in us both</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">В наших жилах течёт кровь одного цвета,</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt-BR">O mesmo sangue corre em nós</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Nelle nostre vene scorre sangue dello stesso colore</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Le même sang coule dans nos veines</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">In unseren Adern fließt dasselbe Blut</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es-419">La misma sangre corre por nuestras venas</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es-ES">Por nuestras venas corre una sangre del mismo color</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ar">نحن نتشارك نفس الدم</span></p><p begin="17.641" end="23.086" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="17.641" end="18.074">そ</span><span begin="18.074" end="18.400">れ</span><span begin="18.400" end="18.858">が</span><span begin="19.098" end="19.422">と</span><span begin="19.422" end="19.737">て</span><span begin="19.737" end="20.066">も</span><span tts:ruby="container" amll:empty-beat="1"><span tts:ruby="base">嬉</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="20.066" end="20.311">う</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="20.311" end="20.622">れ</span></span></span><span begin="20.622" end="21.088">し</span><span begin="21.088" end="22.076">い</span><span begin="22.076" end="22.408">ん</span><span begin="22.408" end="23.086">だ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这让我无比欣喜</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">光是如此便足以欣喜</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">And that alone makes me happy</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">и это наполняет меня счастьем.</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt-BR">E só isso já me faz feliz</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">E questo basta a rendermi felice</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Et ça me rend si heureuse</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Das macht mich so glücklich</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es-419">Eso me llena de felicidad</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es-ES">Me basta para ser feliz</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ar">هذا ما يجعلني سعيدًا للغاية</span></p><p begin="23.343" end="27.755" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="23.343" end="23.552">き</span><span begin="23.552" end="23.757">み</span><span begin="23.757" end="24.046">は</span><span begin="24.046" end="24.219">ぼ</span><span begin="24.219" end="24.731">く</span><span begin="24.731" end="25.047">の</span><span tts:ruby="container" amll:empty-beat="1"><span tts:ruby="base">太</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="25.047" end="25.380">た</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="25.380" end="25.724">い</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container" amll:empty-beat="1"><span tts:ruby="base">陽</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="25.724" end="26.010">よ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="26.010" end="27.755">う</span></span></span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你就是我的太阳</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">你是我的太陽</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">You are my sun</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Ты — моё солнце.</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt-BR">Você é o meu sol</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Tu sei il mio sole</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Tu es mon soleil</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Du bist meine Sonne</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es-419">Tú eres mi sol</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es-ES">Tú eres mi sol</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ar">أنت شمسي</span></p><p begin="37.751" end="42.961" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="37.751" end="38.075">と</span><span begin="38.075" end="38.410">め</span><span begin="38.410" end="39.089">ど</span><span begin="39.089" end="39.701">な</span><span begin="39.701" end="40.023">く</span><span tts:ruby="container" amll:empty-beat="1"><span tts:ruby="base">夢</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="40.371" end="40.736">ゆ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="40.736" end="41.067">め</span></span></span><span begin="41.067" end="41.581">を</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">見</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="41.581" end="42.073">み</span></span></span><span begin="42.073" end="42.237">て</span><span begin="42.237" end="42.961">た</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">做着无止尽的梦</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">曾經無盡地追逐夢想</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">I kept dreaming without end</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Я без устали гналась за мечтами.</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt-BR">Continuei sonhando sem parar</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Ho continuato a sognare senza sosta</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Je rêvais sans fin</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Ich habe endlos geträumt</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es-419">Vi un sueño interminable</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es-ES">Nunca he dejado de soñar</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ar">حلمت بلا نهاية</span></p><p begin="43.387" end="48.052" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="43.387" end="43.762">こ</span><span begin="43.762" end="44.079">の</span><span tts:ruby="container" amll:empty-beat="1"><span tts:ruby="base">旅</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="44.079" end="44.382">た</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="44.382" end="44.702">び</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">路</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="44.702" end="45.066">じ</span></span></span><span begin="45.066" end="45.484">が</span><span begin="45.722" end="46.029">い</span><span begin="46.029" end="46.386">つ</span><span begin="46.386" end="46.912">か</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">終</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="46.912" end="47.076">お</span></span></span><span begin="47.076" end="47.575" amll:empty-beat="1">わっ</span><span begin="47.575" end="47.707">て</span><span begin="47.707" end="48.052">も</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">即使这段旅途终将结束</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">縱使這趟旅程 將迎來結束</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Even if this journey comes to an end</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">И даже если однажды наше путешествие закончится,</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt-BR">Mesmo que esta viagem chegue ao fim</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Anche se questo viaggio un giorno finirà</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Et même si ce voyage se termine</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Auch wenn die Reise eines Tages endet</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es-419">Aunque un día termine el viaje</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es-ES">Aunque este viaje termine</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ar">حتى لو انتهت هذه الرحلة يومًا ما</span></p><p begin="48.391" end="53.511" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container" amll:empty-beat="1"><span tts:ruby="base">共</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="48.391" end="48.743">と</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="48.743" end="49.076">も</span></span></span><span begin="49.076" end="49.492">に</span><span tts:ruby="container" amll:empty-beat="1"><span tts:ruby="base">歩</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="49.746" end="50.044">あ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="50.044" end="50.400">ゆ</span></span></span><span begin="50.400" end="50.751">ん</span><span begin="50.751" end="51.056">だ</span><span begin="51.056" end="51.413">こ</span><span begin="51.413" end="51.751">の</span><span tts:ruby="container" amll:empty-beat="1"><span tts:ruby="base">道</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="51.751" end="52.044">み</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="52.044" end="52.421">ち</span></span></span><span begin="52.421" end="52.754">の</span><span begin="52.754" end="53.094">り</span><span begin="53.094" end="53.511">を</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">共同走过的这条路</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">共同走過的這段道路</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">The path we shared together</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">ведь мы его прошли с тобою вместе.</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt-BR">A estrada que trilhamos juntos</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Il cammino che abbiamo percorso insieme</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Ce chemin parcouru ensemble</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Werde ich diesen Weg, den wir gemeinsam gegangen sind</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es-419">Este camino que recorrimos juntas</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es-ES">Este camino que hemos recorrido juntas</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ar">الطريق الذي سلكناه معًا</span></p><p begin="53.699" end="58.911" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="53.699" end="54.052">ぼ</span><span begin="54.052" end="54.425">く</span><span begin="54.425" end="54.865">は</span><span tts:ruby="container" amll:empty-beat="1"><span tts:ruby="base">忘</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="55.067" end="55.274">わ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="55.274" end="55.745">す</span></span></span><span begin="55.745" end="56.076">れ</span><span begin="56.076" end="56.293">は</span><span begin="56.293" end="56.728">し</span><span begin="56.728" end="57.055">な</span><span begin="57.055" end="58.078">い</span><span begin="58.078" end="58.266">だ</span><span begin="58.266" end="58.437">ろ</span><span begin="58.437" end="58.911">う</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我大概永远不会忘记</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">我也會永遠銘記在心</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">I know I won&apos;t forget it</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Я не забуду этот путь никогда,</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt-BR">Sei que jamais esquecerei</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">So che non lo dimenticherò mai</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Je n&apos;oublierai pas</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Niemals vergessen</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es-419">Sé que nunca lo olvidaré</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es-ES">Sé que nunca olvidaré</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ar">لن أنسى أبدًا</span></p><p begin="1:00.717" end="1:05.845" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">無</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:00.717" end="1:01.063">む</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container" amll:empty-beat="1"><span tts:ruby="base">限</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:01.063" end="1:01.409">げ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:01.409" end="1:01.735">ん</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container" amll:empty-beat="1"><span tts:ruby="base">大</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:01.735" end="1:02.078">だ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:02.078" end="1:02.361">い</span></span></span><span begin="1:02.361" end="1:03.013">の</span><span tts:ruby="container" amll:empty-beat="1"><span tts:ruby="base">選</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:03.323" end="1:03.686">せ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:03.686" end="1:04.089">ん</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container" amll:empty-beat="1"><span tts:ruby="base">択</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:04.089" end="1:04.243">た</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:04.243" end="1:04.707">く</span></span></span><span begin="1:04.707" end="1:04.928">の</span><span tts:ruby="container" amll:empty-beat="1"><span tts:ruby="base">中</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:04.928" end="1:05.219">な</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:05.219" end="1:05.390">か</span></span></span><span begin="1:05.390" end="1:05.845">で</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">因为在无限大的选择之中</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">在無限大的抉擇之中</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">In an infinity of choices,</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Среди бесконечного множества дорог</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt-BR">Numa infinidade de escolhas</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Tra infinite possibilità</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Parmi une infinité de choix</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Inmitten unendlicher Möglichkeiten</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es-419">Dentro de infinitas posibilidades</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es-ES">Entre una infinidad de opciones</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ar">وسط خيارات لا حصر لها</span></p><p begin="1:06.074" end="1:10.233" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:06.074" end="1:06.235">ぼ</span><span begin="1:06.235" end="1:06.708">く</span><span begin="1:06.708" end="1:06.898">は</span><span begin="1:06.898" end="1:07.438">き</span><span begin="1:07.438" end="1:07.589">み</span><span begin="1:07.589" end="1:07.857">と</span><span tts:ruby="container" amll:empty-beat="1"><span tts:ruby="base">続</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:08.018" end="1:08.379">つ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:08.379" end="1:08.745">ず</span></span></span><span begin="1:08.745" end="1:09.080">け</span><span begin="1:09.080" end="1:09.422">る</span><span begin="1:09.422" end="1:09.737">こ</span><span begin="1:09.737" end="1:10.088">と</span><span begin="1:10.088" end="1:10.233">を</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我选择了和你继续走下去</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">我選擇與你繼續前行</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">I chose to walk on with you</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">я выбрала идти дальше рядом с тобой.</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt-BR">Decidi continuar ao seu lado</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Ho scelto di continuare insieme a te</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">J&apos;ai choisi de continuer à avancer avec toi</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Habe ich mich entschieden, an deiner Seite zu gehen</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es-419">Elegí continuar junto a ti</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es-ES">He decidido seguir adelante contigo</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ar">اخترت أن أستمر معك</span></p><p begin="1:10.233" end="1:12.212" itunes:key="L12" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container" amll:empty-beat="1"><span tts:ruby="base">選</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:10.233" end="1:10.341">え</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:10.341" end="1:10.748">ら</span></span></span><span begin="1:10.748" end="1:10.923">ん</span><span begin="1:10.923" end="1:11.224">だ</span><span begin="1:11.224" end="1:11.415">か</span><span begin="1:11.415" end="1:12.212">ら</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">因为我选择了你</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">因為我選擇了你</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Because I chose you</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">ведь я выбрала тебя.</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt-BR">porque escolhi você</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">perché ho scelto te</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">car je t&apos;ai choisie</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">weil ich mich für dich entschieden habe</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es-419">porque te elegí</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es-ES">porque te he elegido</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ar">لأنني اخترتك</span></p><p begin="1:12.877" end="1:17.898" itunes:key="L13" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container" amll:empty-beat="1"><span tts:ruby="base">夢</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:12.877" end="1:13.069">ゆ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:13.069" end="1:13.400">め</span></span></span><span begin="1:13.400" end="1:13.589">と</span><span tts:ruby="container" amll:empty-beat="1"><span tts:ruby="base">現</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:13.589" end="1:13.925">げ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:13.925" end="1:14.063">ん</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container" amll:empty-beat="1"><span tts:ruby="base">実</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:14.063" end="1:14.222">じ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:14.222" end="1:14.503">つ</span></span></span><span begin="1:14.503" end="1:14.757">さ</span><span begin="1:14.757" end="1:14.907">え</span><span begin="1:14.907" end="1:15.078">も</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">飛</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:15.263" end="1:15.414">と</span></span></span><span begin="1:15.414" end="1:15.544">び</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">越</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:15.544" end="1:16.087">こ</span></span></span><span begin="1:16.087" end="1:16.239">え</span><span begin="1:16.239" end="1:16.749">た</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">未</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:16.749" end="1:16.919">み</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container" amll:empty-beat="1"><span tts:ruby="base">来</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:16.919" end="1:17.433">ら</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:17.433" end="1:17.582">い</span></span></span><span begin="1:17.582" end="1:17.898">で</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在连梦想与现实都跨越的未来</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">在跨越夢境與現實的未來</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">In a future beyond both dream and reality</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">В будущем, за гранью мечты и реальности</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt-BR">Num futuro além do sonho e da realidade</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">In un futuro che supera persino sogni e realtà</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Dans un futur au-delà du rêve et de la réalité</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">In einer Zukunft jenseits von Traum und Wirklichkeit</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es-419">En un futuro más allá de los sueños y la realidad</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es-ES">En un futuro más allá de los sueños y la realidad</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ar">في مستقبل يتجاوز حتى الأحلام والواقع</span></p><p begin="1:18.087" end="1:21.405" itunes:key="L14" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:18.087" end="1:18.235">ぼ</span><span begin="1:18.235" end="1:18.413">く</span><span begin="1:18.413" end="1:18.714">を</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">呼</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:18.714" end="1:18.928">よ</span></span></span><span begin="1:18.928" end="1:19.323">ぶ</span><span tts:ruby="container" amll:empty-beat="1"><span tts:ruby="base">声</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:19.410" end="1:19.592">こ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:19.592" end="1:20.073">え</span></span></span><span begin="1:20.073" end="1:20.147">が</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">聞</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:20.147" end="1:20.235">き</span></span></span><span begin="1:20.235" end="1:20.584">こ</span><span begin="1:20.584" end="1:20.715">え</span><span begin="1:20.715" end="1:21.405">た</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">听见了呼唤我的声音</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">聽見了呼喚我的聲音</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">I could hear a voice calling me!</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">я услышала голос, зовущий меня!</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt-BR">Pude ouvir uma voz me chamando!</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Ho sentito una voce chiamarmi!</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">J&apos;ai entendu une voix qui m&apos;appelait !</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Hörte ich eine Stimme, die mich rief!</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es-419">¡Escuché una voz llamándome!</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es-ES">¡Escuché una voz que me llamaba!</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ar">سمعت صوتًا يناديني!</span></p><p begin="1:23.073" end="1:26.180" itunes:key="L15" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container" amll:empty-beat="1"><span tts:ruby="base">言</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:23.073" end="1:23.261">こ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:23.261" end="1:23.432">と</span></span></span><span begin="1:23.432" end="1:23.600">の</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">葉</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:23.600" end="1:23.752">は</span></span></span><span begin="1:23.752" end="1:24.071">が</span><span tts:ruby="container" amll:empty-beat="1"><span tts:ruby="base">色</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:24.071" end="1:24.272">い</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:24.272" end="1:24.741">ろ</span></span></span><span begin="1:24.741" end="1:24.921">づ</span><span begin="1:24.921" end="1:25.404">く</span><span begin="1:25.404" end="1:25.576">た</span><span begin="1:25.576" end="1:25.908">び</span><span begin="1:25.908" end="1:26.180">に</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">当言语染上色彩时</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">每當話語染上色彩</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Every time words turn bright</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">каждый раз, когда расцветают слова</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt-BR">Sempre que as palavras ganham cor</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Ogni volta che le parole prendono colore,</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Quand chaque mot se colore</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Jedes Mal, wenn Worte sich färben</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es-419">¡Debo decirlo cada vez que las palabras se iluminan!</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es-ES">¡Cuando las palabras toman color,</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ar">يجب أن أخبرك في كل مرة تتلون فيها الكلمات</span></p><p begin="1:26.180" end="1:28.020" itunes:key="L16" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container" amll:empty-beat="1"><span tts:ruby="base">伝</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:26.180" end="1:26.393">つ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:26.393" end="1:26.732">た</span></span></span><span begin="1:26.732" end="1:26.915">え</span><span begin="1:26.915" end="1:27.124">な</span><span begin="1:27.243" end="1:27.453">く</span><span begin="1:27.534" end="1:28.020">ちゃ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">一定要倾诉心意</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">就該傳達出去</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">I have to say it!</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Я должна тебе всё сказать!</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt-BR">Eu preciso dizer!!!</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Devo dirlo!!!</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Je me dois de l&apos;exprimer !!!</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Muss ich es dir sagen!!!</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es-419">Tengo que decirlo</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es-ES">tengo que transmitirlas!</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ar">يجب أن أقولها</span></p><p begin="1:28.428" end="1:30.748" itunes:key="L17" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:28.428" end="1:28.637">ど</span><span begin="1:28.637" end="1:28.759">ん</span><span begin="1:28.759" end="1:28.810">な</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">時</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:28.810" end="1:28.920">じ</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container" amll:empty-beat="1"><span tts:ruby="base">代</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:28.920" end="1:29.776">だ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:29.776" end="1:30.074">い</span></span></span><span begin="1:30.074" end="1:30.256">で</span><span begin="1:30.256" end="1:30.748">も</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">无论哪个时代</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">任何時代</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">No matter the time,</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Ведь в любую эпоху</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt-BR">Não importa o tempo</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">In qualunque epoca</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Quelle que soit l&apos;époque</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Egal zu welcher Zeit</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es-419">En cualquier era</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es-ES">No importa la época</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ar">مهما كان الوقت</span></p><p begin="1:31.052" end="1:34.001" itunes:key="L18" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container" amll:empty-beat="1"><span tts:ruby="base">大</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:31.052" end="1:31.418">た</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:31.418" end="1:31.623">い</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container" amll:empty-beat="1"><span tts:ruby="base">切</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:31.623" end="1:31.940">せ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:31.940" end="1:32.087">つ</span></span></span><span begin="1:32.087" end="1:32.305">な</span><span begin="1:32.305" end="1:32.591">ん</span><span begin="1:32.591" end="1:32.810">だ</span> <span tts:ruby="container" amll:empty-beat="1"><span tts:ruby="base">愛</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:32.916" end="1:33.047">あ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:33.047" end="1:33.208">い</span></span></span><span begin="1:33.208" end="1:33.271">は</span><span tts:ruby="container" amll:empty-beat="1"><span tts:ruby="base">衝</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:33.271" end="1:33.647">しょう</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container" amll:empty-beat="1"><span tts:ruby="base">動</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:33.763" end="1:33.923">ど</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:33.923" end="1:34.001">う</span></span></span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">都无比珍贵 爱是冲动</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">都要無比珍惜 愛是衝動</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">It&apos;s something precious, love is energy</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">есть важная штука: любовь — это импульс.</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt-BR">É algo precioso, o amor é um impulso</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">È importante, l&apos;amore è un impulso</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Il est précieux, l&apos;amour est une impulsion</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Sie ist wichtig: Liebe ist ein Impuls</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es-419">Es importante, amar es un impulso</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es-ES">El impulso del amor siempre será esencial</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ar">يبقى الحب مهمًا، دافعًا</span></p><p begin="1:34.241" end="1:36.583" itunes:key="L19" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container" amll:empty-beat="1"><span tts:ruby="base">答</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:34.241" end="1:34.416">こ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:34.416" end="1:34.606">た</span></span></span><span begin="1:34.606" end="1:34.761">え</span><span begin="1:34.761" end="1:35.018">な</span><span begin="1:35.018" end="1:35.409">ん</span><span begin="1:35.409" end="1:35.583">て</span><span begin="1:35.583" end="1:35.729">な</span><span begin="1:35.729" end="1:36.050">い</span><span begin="1:36.050" end="1:36.282">か</span><span begin="1:36.282" end="1:36.583">ら</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">因为没有标准答案</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">既然沒有標準答案</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">There&apos;s no answer</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Правильного ответа нет —</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt-BR">Não existe resposta,</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Non esistono risposte giuste,</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Il n&apos;y a pas de bonne réponse</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Es gibt keine Antwort</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es-419">¡No hay una respuesta,</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es-ES">No hay respuesta</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ar">لا توجد إجابات،</span></p><p begin="1:36.732" end="1:38.760" itunes:key="L20" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">自</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:36.732" end="1:36.910">じ</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container" amll:empty-beat="1"><span tts:ruby="base">分</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:36.910" end="1:37.074">ぶ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:37.074" end="1:37.336">ん</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">次</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:37.336" end="1:37.592">し</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container" amll:empty-beat="1"><span tts:ruby="base">第</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:37.592" end="1:37.804">だ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:37.904" end="1:38.089">い</span></span></span><span begin="1:38.188" end="1:38.760" amll:empty-beat="2">じゃん</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">全凭自己的选择</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">就由自己作主</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">So it&apos;s up to you!!</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">решай для себя всё сам!!</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt-BR">depende de você!!</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">dipende da te!!</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Tout dépend de nous !!</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Es liegt an uns selbst!!</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es-419">depende de ti!</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es-ES">¡Depende de una misma!</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ar">الأمر لك!!</span></p><p begin="1:39.095" end="1:41.564" itunes:key="L21" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:39.095" end="1:39.268">ど</span><span begin="1:39.268" end="1:39.428">ん</span><span begin="1:39.428" end="1:39.505">な</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">不</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:39.505" end="1:39.593">ふ</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container" amll:empty-beat="1"><span tts:ruby="base">安</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:39.593" end="1:40.423">あ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:40.423" end="1:40.584">ん</span></span></span><span begin="1:40.584" end="1:40.896">さ</span><span begin="1:40.896" end="1:41.564">え</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">无论怎样的不安</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">任何不安</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Even every fear</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Любую тревогу</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt-BR">Mesmo qualquer medo</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Qualunque paura tu abbia</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Même les inquiétudes</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Selbst die größte Unsicherheit</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es-419">Cualquier inseguridad</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es-ES">Hasta los peores temores</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ar">يمكنه تبديد أي قلق</span></p><p begin="1:41.705" end="1:44.764" itunes:key="L22" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">蹴</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:41.705" end="1:42.057">け</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">散</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:42.057" end="1:42.415">ち</span></span></span><span begin="1:42.415" end="1:42.587">ら</span><span begin="1:42.587" end="1:42.746">す</span><span begin="1:42.746" end="1:42.923">よ</span><span begin="1:42.923" end="1:43.253">う</span><span begin="1:43.253" end="1:43.480">な</span> <span tts:ruby="container" amll:empty-beat="1"><span tts:ruby="base">愛</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:43.601" end="1:43.752">あ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:43.752" end="1:43.873">い</span></span></span><span begin="1:43.903" end="1:44.002">は</span><span tts:ruby="container" amll:empty-beat="1"><span tts:ruby="base">衝</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:44.038" end="1:44.252">しょう</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container" amll:empty-beat="1"><span tts:ruby="base">動</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:44.422" end="1:44.615">ど</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:44.615" end="1:44.764">う</span></span></span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">都能够驱散 爱是冲动</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">都能一腳踢開 愛是衝動</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Gets swept away by love as energy</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">сметает прочь любовь-импульс.</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt-BR">É varrido pelo impulso do amor</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">L&apos;amore è un impulso che la spazza via</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Se font balayer car l&apos;amour est une impulsion</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Wird von ihr vertrieben, Liebe ist ein Impuls</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es-419">Mándala a volar, amar es un impulso</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es-ES">Disipará el impulso del amor</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ar">الحب دافع</span></p><p begin="1:45.055" end="1:47.097" itunes:key="L23" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:45.055" end="1:45.195">い</span><span begin="1:45.195" end="1:45.371">つ</span><span begin="1:45.371" end="1:45.579">か</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">見</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:45.579" end="1:45.723">み</span></span></span><span begin="1:45.723" end="1:45.957">た</span><span tts:ruby="container" amll:empty-beat="1"><span tts:ruby="base">夢</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:46.061" end="1:46.245">ゆ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:46.245" end="1:46.413">め</span></span></span><span begin="1:46.413" end="1:46.586">の</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">果</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:46.586" end="1:46.749">は</span></span></span><span begin="1:46.749" end="1:47.059">て</span><span begin="1:47.059" end="1:47.097">、</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">到曾经梦想的尽头</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">朝著曾看過的夢想盡頭</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Past the edge of a dream I once saw</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Полетим туда, где исполняется давняя мечта —</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt-BR">Além da fronteira de um sonho que tive uma vez,</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Oltre il confine di quel sogno che vidi un giorno,</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Dépassant un rêve que j&apos;ai fait</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Bis ans Ende meines Traumes</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es-419">Pasando del sueño que vimos,</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es-ES">Más allá de aquel sueño que tuve</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ar">إلى ما وراء حدود الحلم الذي رأيته ذات مرة</span></p><p begin="1:47.192" end="1:50.789" itunes:key="L24" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:47.192" end="1:47.411">そ</span><span begin="1:47.411" end="1:47.590">の</span><span begin="1:47.590" end="1:47.719">も</span><span begin="1:47.719" end="1:47.987">っ</span><span begin="1:48.065" end="1:48.237">と</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">遠</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:48.237" end="1:48.414">と</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:48.414" end="1:48.500">お</span></span></span><span begin="1:48.500" end="1:48.589">く</span><span begin="1:48.589" end="1:48.905">ま</span><span begin="1:48.905" end="1:50.789">で</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">到更远的远方</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">甚至更遙遠的彼方</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Even further</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">и дальше за её пределы.</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt-BR">ainda mais longe</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">ancora più lontano</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Encore plus loin</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">und noch weiter</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es-419">mucho más allá</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es-ES">Mucho más allá</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ar">بل أبعد من ذلك</span></p><p begin="1:51.070" end="1:53.524" itunes:key="L25" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:51.070" end="1:51.394">パー</span><span begin="1:51.394" end="1:51.751">ティー</span><span begin="1:51.751" end="1:52.053">を</span><span tts:ruby="container" amll:empty-beat="1"><span tts:ruby="base">続</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:52.053" end="1:52.241">つ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:52.241" end="1:52.738">ず</span></span></span><span begin="1:52.738" end="1:52.946">け</span><span begin="1:52.946" end="1:53.084">よ</span><span begin="1:53.084" end="1:53.419">う</span><span begin="1:53.419" end="1:53.524">、</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">让派对继续吧</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">讓派對繼續下去</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Let&apos;s keep the party going</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Перешагнём любовь и ненависть, и пусть продолжается вечеринка.</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt-BR">Vamos seguir com a festa</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Continuiamo la festa,</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Continuons à faire la fête</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Wir feiern weiter</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es-419">Continuemos la fiesta,</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es-ES">Que siga la fiesta</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ar">لنكمل الاحتفال،</span></p><p begin="1:53.665" end="1:59.684" itunes:key="L26" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">好</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:53.665" end="1:54.085">す</span></span></span><span begin="1:54.085" end="1:54.413">き</span><span begin="1:54.413" end="1:54.689">も</span><span tts:ruby="container" amll:empty-beat="1"><span tts:ruby="base">嫌</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:54.689" end="1:54.928">き</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:54.928" end="1:55.415">ら</span></span></span><span begin="1:55.415" end="1:55.586">い</span><span begin="1:55.586" end="1:55.923">も</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">超</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:56.057" end="1:56.392">こ</span></span></span><span begin="1:56.392" end="1:56.744">え</span><span begin="1:56.744" end="1:59.684">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">超越喜爱与厌恶</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">超越一切好惡</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Beyond love and hate</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Перешагнём любовь и ненависть</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt-BR">Superando o amor e o ódio</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">oltre ciò che amiamo e ciò che odiamo</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Au-delà de l&apos;amour et de la haine</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Lassen Liebe und Hass hinter uns</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es-419">más allá del amor y el odio</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es-ES">Más allá de gustos y disgustos</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ar">متجاوزين الحب والكراهية</span></p><p begin="2:07.025" end="2:12.444" itunes:key="L27" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container" amll:empty-beat="1"><span tts:ruby="base">絶</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:07.025" end="2:07.185">ぜ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:07.185" end="2:07.395">つ</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container" amll:empty-beat="1"><span tts:ruby="base">望</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:07.395" end="2:07.585">ぼ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:07.585" end="2:07.751">う</span></span></span><span begin="2:07.751" end="2:08.006">の</span><span tts:ruby="container" amll:empty-beat="1"><span tts:ruby="base">先</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:08.006" end="2:08.231">さ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:08.231" end="2:08.754">き</span></span></span><span begin="2:08.754" end="2:08.930">に</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">見</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:08.930" end="2:09.432">み</span></span></span><span begin="2:09.432" end="2:09.594">え</span><span begin="2:09.594" end="2:09.856">た</span> <span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">希</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:09.891" end="2:10.060">き</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container" amll:empty-beat="1"><span tts:ruby="base">望</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:10.060" end="2:10.255">ぼ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:10.255" end="2:10.404">う</span></span></span><span begin="2:10.404" end="2:10.718">と</span><span begin="2:10.718" end="2:10.922">い</span><span begin="2:10.922" end="2:11.412">う</span><span tts:ruby="container" amll:empty-beat="2"><span tts:ruby="base">病</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:11.412" end="2:11.583">や</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:11.583" end="2:12.079">ま</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:12.079" end="2:12.229">い</span></span></span><span begin="2:12.229" end="2:12.444">が</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">绝望尽头浮现的名为希望的病</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">絕望盡頭浮現的名為希望的病</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">The illness called hope, seen beyond despair</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Болезнь по имени надежда, явившаяся за гранью отчаяния,</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt-BR">A doença chamada esperança, que surgiu além do desespero,</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">La malattia chiamata speranza, apparsa oltre la disperazione,</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Cette maladie qu&apos;est l&apos;espoir, aperçue au-delà du désespoir,</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Die Krankheit namens Hoffnung, die jenseits der Verzweiflung erschien,</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es-419">La enfermedad llamada esperanza, que vi más allá de la desesperación,</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es-ES">La enfermedad llamada esperanza, que vi más allá de la desesperación,</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ar">مرض الأمل الذي رأيته وراء اليأس</span></p><p begin="2:12.711" end="2:17.596" itunes:key="L28" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:12.711" end="2:12.919">あ</span><span begin="2:12.919" end="2:13.084">ま</span><span begin="2:13.084" end="2:13.429">り</span><span begin="2:13.429" end="2:13.589">に</span><span begin="2:13.589" end="2:13.753">も</span><span tts:ruby="container" amll:empty-beat="1"><span tts:ruby="base">眩</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:14.083" end="2:14.390">ま</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:14.390" end="2:14.662">ぶ</span></span></span><span begin="2:14.662" end="2:15.061">し</span><span begin="2:15.061" end="2:15.407">く</span><span tts:ruby="container" amll:empty-beat="1"><span tts:ruby="base">輝</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:15.407" end="2:15.722">か</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:15.722" end="2:16.064">が</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:16.064" end="2:16.235">や</span></span></span><span begin="2:16.235" end="2:16.744">く</span><span begin="2:16.744" end="2:16.908">か</span><span begin="2:16.908" end="2:17.596">ら</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">闪耀得如此耀眼</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">閃耀得如此耀眼</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Shines far too brightly</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">сияет ослепительно ярко.</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt-BR">brilha intensamente demais.</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">brilla di una luce accecante.</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">brille d&apos;un éclat éblouissant.</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">leuchtet viel zu hell.</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es-419">brilla con un resplandor cegador.</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es-ES">brilla con un resplandor cegador.</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ar">يتوهج بسطوعٍ مبهر.</span></p><p begin="2:17.901" end="2:20.324" itunes:key="L29" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">果</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:17.901" end="2:18.078">は</span></span></span><span begin="2:18.078" end="2:18.176">て</span><span begin="2:18.176" end="2:18.401">し</span><span begin="2:18.401" end="2:18.744">の</span><span begin="2:18.744" end="2:18.908">な</span><span begin="2:18.908" end="2:19.319">い</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">世</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:19.319" end="2:19.581">せ</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container" amll:empty-beat="1"><span tts:ruby="base">界</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:19.581" end="2:19.738">か</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:19.738" end="2:20.324">い</span></span></span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在这无边无际的世界</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">在這無邊無際的世界</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">In this endless world</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">В этом бескрайнем мире</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt-BR">Neste mundo sem fim,</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">In questo mondo sconfinato,</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Dans ce monde sans fin,</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">In dieser grenzenlosen Welt,</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es-419">En este mundo sin fin,</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es-ES">En este mundo sin fin,</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ar">في هذا العالم اللامتناهي،</span></p><p begin="2:20.548" end="2:22.785" itunes:key="L30" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:20.548" end="2:20.736">あ</span><span begin="2:20.736" end="2:20.914">と</span><span begin="2:20.914" end="2:21.066">ど</span><span begin="2:21.066" end="2:21.276">れ</span><span begin="2:21.276" end="2:21.415">く</span><span begin="2:21.415" end="2:21.593">ら</span><span begin="2:21.593" end="2:21.883">い</span><span begin="2:21.883" end="2:22.042">の</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">時</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:22.042" end="2:22.223">じ</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container" amll:empty-beat="1"><span tts:ruby="base">間</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:22.223" end="2:22.572">か</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:22.572" end="2:22.785">ん</span></span></span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我还能与你共度多少时光呢</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">我還能與你共度多少時光呢</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">How much longer will I be able to stay with you?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">сколько ещё времени я смогу быть с тобой?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt-BR">por quanto tempo ainda poderei ficar com você?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">per quanto tempo ancora potrò restare con te?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">combien de temps encore pourrai-je rester avec toi ?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">wie lange noch kann ich bei dir sein?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es-419">¿cuánto tiempo más podré estar contigo?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es-ES">¿cuánto tiempo más podré estar contigo?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ar">كم من الوقت بعد سأتمكن من البقاء معك؟</span></p><p begin="2:23.059" end="2:29.361" itunes:key="L31" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:23.059" end="2:23.295">ぼ</span><span begin="2:23.295" end="2:23.587">く</span><span begin="2:23.587" end="2:23.723">は</span><span begin="2:23.723" end="2:24.073">き</span><span begin="2:24.073" end="2:24.230">み</span><span begin="2:24.230" end="2:24.726">と</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">居</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:24.726" end="2:24.928">い</span></span></span><span begin="2:24.928" end="2:25.416">ら</span><span begin="2:25.416" end="2:25.564">れ</span><span begin="2:25.564" end="2:25.930">る</span><span begin="2:25.930" end="2:26.075">ん</span><span begin="2:26.075" end="2:26.250">だ</span><span begin="2:26.250" end="2:29.361" amll:empty-beat="1">ろう</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我还能与你在一起吧</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">我還能和你在一起吧</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">How much longer can I stay with you?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">сколько ещё я смогу быть с тобой?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt-BR">por quanto tempo poderei ficar com você?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">per quanto tempo potrò stare con te?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">combien de temps pourrai-je rester avec toi ?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">wie lange kann ich noch bei dir sein?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es-419">¿cuánto tiempo podré estar contigo?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es-ES">¿cuánto tiempo podré estar contigo?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ar">كم من الوقت سأتمكن من البقاء معك؟</span></p><p begin="2:30.929" end="2:33.868" itunes:key="L32" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:30.929" end="2:31.227">さ</span><span begin="2:31.227" end="2:31.448">よ</span><span begin="2:31.448" end="2:31.585">な</span><span begin="2:31.585" end="2:31.745">ら</span><span begin="2:31.745" end="2:32.044">を</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">告</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:32.044" end="2:32.244">つ</span></span></span><span begin="2:32.244" end="2:32.743">げ</span><span begin="2:32.743" end="2:32.908">る</span><span tts:ruby="container" amll:empty-beat="1"><span tts:ruby="base">頃</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:32.908" end="2:33.445">こ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:33.445" end="2:33.594">ろ</span></span></span><span begin="2:33.594" end="2:33.868">に</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">说出再见的那一刻</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">到了說再見的時候</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">When it&apos;s time to say goodbye</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Когда придёт время прощаться,</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt-BR">Quando chegar a hora de dizer adeus</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Quando arriverà il momento di dirci addio,</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">L&apos;heure des adieux arrive</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Wenn ich mich von dir verabschiede</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es-419">Al momento de decir adiós,</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es-ES">Cuando llegue el momento de despedirnos</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ar">عندما يحين وقت الوداع</span></p><p begin="2:34.036" end="2:36.063" itunes:key="L33" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container" amll:empty-beat="1"><span tts:ruby="base">思</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:34.036" end="2:34.267">お</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:34.267" end="2:34.427">も</span></span></span><span begin="2:34.427" end="2:34.737">い</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">出</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:34.737" end="2:34.836">だ</span></span></span><span begin="2:34.836" end="2:35.365">す</span><span begin="2:35.365" end="2:35.569">の</span><span begin="2:35.569" end="2:36.063">は</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">脑海中浮现的</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">最先想起的是</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">I remember</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">я вспомню</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt-BR">Eu me lembrarei</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">ricorderò</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Et je me souviens</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Erinnere ich mich</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es-419">lo que recuerdo</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es-ES">Recordaré</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ar">أتذكر</span></p><p begin="2:36.372" end="2:41.415" itunes:key="L34" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">綺</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:36.372" end="2:36.579">き</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container" amll:empty-beat="1"><span tts:ruby="base">麗</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:36.579" end="2:36.760">れ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:36.760" end="2:36.944">い</span></span></span><span begin="2:36.944" end="2:37.419">な</span><span tts:ruby="container" amll:empty-beat="1"><span tts:ruby="base">面</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:37.419" end="2:37.590">お</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:37.590" end="2:38.087">も</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container" amll:empty-beat="1"><span tts:ruby="base">影</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:38.087" end="2:38.258">か</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:38.258" end="2:38.735">げ</span></span></span><span begin="2:38.735" end="2:38.851">、</span><span tts:ruby="container" amll:empty-beat="1"><span tts:ruby="base">若</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:39.284" end="2:39.411">わ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:39.411" end="2:39.524">か</span></span></span><span begin="2:39.524" end="2:39.745">す</span><span begin="2:39.745" end="2:40.087">ぎ</span><span begin="2:40.087" end="2:40.218">た</span><span tts:ruby="container" amll:empty-beat="1"><span tts:ruby="base">僕</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:40.218" end="2:40.727">ぼ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:40.727" end="2:40.917">く</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">等</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:40.917" end="2:41.415">ら</span></span></span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">是美丽的面容 太过年少的我们</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">那美麗的身影 以及青澀的我們</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Your beautiful shadow, and how young we were</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">твоё лицо и нас — таких юных.</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt-BR">Da sua bela imagem e de como éramos jovens</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">La tua bellissima immagine e noi, troppo giovani</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">De nos beaux souvenirs et d&apos;à quel point nous étions jeunes</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">An deine wunderschöne Gestalt und daran, wie jung wir waren</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es-419">Son bellas sombras, nuestra juventud</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es-ES">tu bella imagen y lo jóvenes que éramos</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ar">وجهكِ الجميل، ونحن، صغارًا جدًا</span></p><p begin="2:41.735" end="2:44.455" itunes:key="L35" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:41.735" end="2:41.920">&quot;ご</span><span begin="2:41.920" end="2:42.101">め</span><span begin="2:42.101" end="2:42.259">ん</span><span begin="2:42.259" end="2:42.420">ね&quot;</span><span begin="2:42.420" end="2:42.673">も</span><span begin="2:42.673" end="2:42.939">&quot;あ</span><span begin="2:42.939" end="2:43.427">り</span><span begin="2:43.427" end="2:43.595">が</span><span begin="2:43.595" end="2:44.112">と</span><span begin="2:44.112" end="2:44.260">う&quot;</span><span begin="2:44.260" end="2:44.455">も</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">“对不起”与“谢谢你”</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">「對不起」和「謝謝」</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">&quot;I&apos;m sorry&quot; and &quot;thank you&quot;</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">«прости» и «спасибо».</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt-BR">um &quot;me desculpe&quot; ou &quot;obrigada&quot;</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">&quot;le scuse&quot; e &quot;i grazie&quot;</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">&quot;Pardon&quot; et &quot;merci&quot;</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">&quot;Entschuldigung&quot; und &quot;Danke&quot;</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es-419">&quot;perdón&quot; y &quot;gracias&quot;</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es-ES">un &quot;perdón&quot; y un &quot;gracias&quot;</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ar">كلمتي «آسف» و«شكرًا»</span></p><p begin="2:44.770" end="2:47.749" itunes:key="L36" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container" amll:empty-beat="1"><span tts:ruby="base">描</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:44.770" end="2:44.930">え</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:44.930" end="2:45.071">が</span></span></span><span begin="2:45.071" end="2:45.432">け</span><span begin="2:45.432" end="2:45.592">る</span><span begin="2:45.592" end="2:46.082">の</span><span begin="2:46.082" end="2:46.257">な</span><span begin="2:46.257" end="2:47.749">ら</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">若是能写下</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">倘若也能描繪出來</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">If only I could draw</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Ах, если б я могла нарисовать</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt-BR">Se soubesse ao menos desenhar</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Se potessi dipingere</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Si seulement j&apos;avais pu dire</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Könnte ich nur zeichnen</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es-419">Quisiera pintar</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es-ES">Si pudiera dibujar</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ar">ليتني أستطيع أن أرسم</span></p><p begin="2:52.410" end="2:57.313" itunes:key="L37" ttm:agent="v2"><span tts:ruby="container" amll:empty-beat="1"><span tts:ruby="base">言</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:52.410" end="2:52.577">こ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:52.577" end="2:52.692">と</span></span></span><span begin="2:52.692" end="2:52.865">の</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">葉</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:52.865" end="2:53.072">は</span></span></span><span begin="2:53.072" end="2:53.419">が</span><span tts:ruby="container" amll:empty-beat="1"><span tts:ruby="base">色</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:53.419" end="2:53.592">い</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:53.592" end="2:54.015">ろ</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">付</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:54.015" end="2:54.234">ず</span></span></span><span begin="2:54.234" end="2:54.680">く</span><span begin="2:54.758" end="2:54.923">た</span><span begin="2:54.923" end="2:55.238">び</span><span begin="2:55.238" end="2:55.513">に</span><span tts:ruby="container" amll:empty-beat="1"><span tts:ruby="base">夢</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:55.513" end="2:55.740">ゆ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:55.740" end="2:56.089">め</span></span></span><span begin="2:56.089" end="2:56.228">を</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">見</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:56.228" end="2:56.671">み</span></span></span><span begin="2:56.764" end="2:56.906">て</span><span begin="2:56.906" end="2:57.313">た</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">当言语染上色彩时就看到了梦想</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">每當話語染上色彩 總在追逐夢想</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Every time words turn bright, I have to say it</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Я мечтаю каждый раз, когда расцветают слова.</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt-BR">Sempre que as palavras ganhavam cor, eu sonhava outra vez</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Continuerò a sognare ogni volta che le parole prendono colore</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">J&apos;en rêvais quand chaque mot se colorait</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Jedes Mal, wenn Worte sich färben, habe ich geträumt</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es-419">¡Vi el sueño cada vez que las palabras se iluminan!</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es-ES">Cada vez que las palabras tomaban color, soñaba</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ar">حلمتُ بالكلمات وهي تتلون</span></p><p begin="2:57.750" end="2:59.993" itunes:key="L38" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="2:57.750" end="2:58.000">ど</span><span begin="2:58.000" end="2:58.083">ん</span><span begin="2:58.083" end="2:58.152">な</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">時</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:58.152" end="2:58.268">じ</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container" amll:empty-beat="1"><span tts:ruby="base">代</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:58.268" end="2:59.095">だ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:59.095" end="2:59.420">い</span></span></span><span begin="2:59.420" end="2:59.591">で</span><span begin="2:59.591" end="2:59.993">も</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">无论哪个时代</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">任何時代</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">No matter the time</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Ведь в любую эпоху</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt-BR">Não importa o tempo</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">In qualunque epoca</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Quelle que soit l&apos;époque</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Egal zu welcher Zeit</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es-419">En cualquier era</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es-ES">No importa la época</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ar">مهما كان الوقت</span></p><p begin="3:00.378" end="3:03.425" itunes:key="L39" ttm:agent="v2"><span tts:ruby="container" amll:empty-beat="1"><span tts:ruby="base">大</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:00.378" end="3:00.731">た</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:00.731" end="3:00.953">い</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container" amll:empty-beat="1"><span tts:ruby="base">切</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:00.953" end="3:01.285">せ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:01.285" end="3:01.413">つ</span></span></span><span begin="3:01.413" end="3:01.575">な</span><span begin="3:01.575" end="3:01.892">ん</span><span begin="3:01.892" end="3:02.175">だ</span><span begin="3:02.175" end="3:02.251">、</span><span tts:ruby="container" amll:empty-beat="1"><span tts:ruby="base">愛</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:02.251" end="3:02.422">あ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:02.422" end="3:02.563">い</span></span></span><span begin="3:02.563" end="3:02.651">は</span><span tts:ruby="container" amll:empty-beat="1"><span tts:ruby="base">衝</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:02.651" end="3:03.011">しょう</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container" amll:empty-beat="1"><span tts:ruby="base">動</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:03.090" end="3:03.215">ど</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:03.215" end="3:03.425">う</span></span></span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">都无比珍贵 爱是冲动</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">都要無比珍惜 愛是衝動</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">It&apos;s something precious, love is energy</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">есть важная штука: любовь — это импульс.</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt-BR">É algo precioso, o amor é um impulso</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">È importante, l&apos;amore è un impulso</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Il est précieux, l&apos;amour est une impulsion</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Sie ist wichtig: Liebe ist ein Impuls</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es-419">Es importante, amar es un impulso</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es-ES">El impulso del amor siempre será esencial</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ar">يبقى الحب مهمًا، دافعًا</span></p><p begin="3:03.526" end="3:05.991" itunes:key="L40" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:03.526" end="3:03.721">す</span><span begin="3:03.721" end="3:03.964">れ</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">違</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:03.964" end="3:04.097">ち</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:04.097" end="3:04.239">が</span></span></span><span begin="3:04.239" end="3:04.745">う</span><span begin="3:04.745" end="3:04.944">た</span><span begin="3:04.944" end="3:05.416">び</span><span begin="3:05.416" end="3:05.523">に</span><span begin="3:05.523" end="3:05.919">さ</span><span begin="3:05.919" end="3:05.991">、</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">每次产生误解</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">每當與你擦肩而過</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Every time we pass,</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Каждый раз, когда наши пути расходятся,</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt-BR">Sempre que nos cruzamos</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Ogni volta che ci incrociamo</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Chaque fois qu&apos;on se croise</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Jedes Mal, wenn wir aneinander vorbeigehen,</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es-419">Cada vez que nos cruzamos,</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es-ES">Cada vez que nos cruzamos,</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ar">في كل مرةٍ نختلف فيها،</span></p><p begin="3:06.049" end="3:08.094" itunes:key="L41" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:06.049" end="3:06.247">き</span><span begin="3:06.247" end="3:06.414">み</span><span begin="3:06.414" end="3:06.726">を</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">知</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:06.726" end="3:06.914">し</span></span></span><span begin="3:06.914" end="3:07.261">れ</span><span begin="3:07.261" end="3:07.379">る</span><span begin="3:07.379" end="3:07.592">か</span><span begin="3:07.592" end="3:08.094">ら</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">都能更了解你</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">就能更加瞭解</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">I get to know you more</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">я узнаю тебя лучше.</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt-BR">Acabo te conhecendo mais</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Riesco a conoscerti un po&apos; di più</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Je te connais un peu mieux</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">kenne ich dich besser</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es-419">puedo conocerte más</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es-ES">te conozco un poco más</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ar">أتعرف عليكِ أكثر</span></p><p begin="3:08.428" end="3:10.758" itunes:key="L42" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:08.428" end="3:08.611">ど</span><span begin="3:08.611" end="3:08.764">ん</span><span begin="3:08.764" end="3:08.875">な</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">不</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:08.875" end="3:08.945">ふ</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container" amll:empty-beat="1"><span tts:ruby="base">安</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:08.945" end="3:09.774">あ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:09.774" end="3:09.971">ん</span></span></span><span begin="3:09.971" end="3:10.248">さ</span><span begin="3:10.248" end="3:10.758">え</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">无论怎样的不安</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">任何不安</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Even every fear</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Любую тревогу</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt-BR">Mesmo qualquer medo</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Qualunque paura tu abbia</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Même les inquiétudes</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Selbst die größte Unsicherheit</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es-419">Cualquier inseguridad</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es-ES">Hasta los peores temores</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ar">أي قلق</span></p><p begin="3:11.065" end="3:14.221" itunes:key="L43" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">蹴</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:11.065" end="3:11.377">け</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">散</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:11.377" end="3:11.740">ち</span></span></span><span begin="3:11.740" end="3:11.954">ら</span><span begin="3:11.954" end="3:12.071">す</span><span begin="3:12.071" end="3:12.265">よ</span><span begin="3:12.265" end="3:12.545">う</span><span begin="3:12.545" end="3:12.825">な</span><span begin="3:12.825" end="3:12.929">、</span><span tts:ruby="container" amll:empty-beat="1"><span tts:ruby="base">愛</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:12.929" end="3:13.133">あ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:13.133" end="3:13.253">い</span></span></span><span begin="3:13.253" end="3:13.332">は</span><span tts:ruby="container" amll:empty-beat="1"><span tts:ruby="base">衝</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:13.332" end="3:13.760">しょう</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container" amll:empty-beat="1"><span tts:ruby="base">動</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:13.760" end="3:14.102">ど</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:14.102" end="3:14.221">う</span></span></span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">都能够驱散 爱是冲动</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">都能一腳踢開 愛是衝動</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Gets swept away by love as energy</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">сметает прочь любовь-импульс.</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt-BR">É varrido pelo impulso do amor</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">L&apos;amore è un impulso che la spazza via</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Se font balayer car l&apos;amour est une impulsion</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Wird von ihr vertrieben, Liebe ist ein Impuls</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es-419">Mándala a volar, amar es un impulso</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es-ES">Disipará el impulso del amor</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ar">الحب دافع</span></p><p begin="3:14.411" end="3:16.416" itunes:key="L44" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:14.411" end="3:14.553">い</span><span begin="3:14.553" end="3:14.761">つ</span><span begin="3:14.761" end="3:14.921">か</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">見</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:14.921" end="3:15.079">み</span></span></span><span begin="3:15.079" end="3:15.279">た</span><span tts:ruby="container" amll:empty-beat="1"><span tts:ruby="base">夢</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:15.364" end="3:15.580">ゆ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:15.580" end="3:15.748">め</span></span></span><span begin="3:15.748" end="3:15.865">の</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">果</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:15.865" end="3:16.089">は</span></span></span><span begin="3:16.089" end="3:16.381">て</span><span begin="3:16.381" end="3:16.400">、</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">到曾经梦想的尽头</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">朝著曾看過的夢想盡頭</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Past the edge of a dream I once saw,</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Полетим туда, где исполняется давняя мечта —</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt-BR">Além da fronteira de um sonho que tive uma vez,</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Oltre il confine di quel sogno che vidi un giorno,</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Dépassant un rêve que j&apos;ai fait</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Bis ans Ende meines Traumes</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es-419">Pasando del sueño que vimos,</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es-ES">Más allá de aquel sueño que tuve</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ar">إلى نهاية الحلم الذي رأيته ذات مرة</span></p><p begin="3:16.533" end="3:18.911" itunes:key="L45" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:16.533" end="3:16.748">そ</span><span begin="3:16.748" end="3:16.929">の</span><span begin="3:16.929" end="3:17.073">も</span><span begin="3:17.073" end="3:17.418">っ</span><span begin="3:17.418" end="3:17.578">と</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">遠</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:17.578" end="3:17.718">と</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:17.718" end="3:17.787">お</span></span></span><span begin="3:17.787" end="3:17.913">く</span><span begin="3:17.913" end="3:18.234">ま</span><span begin="3:18.234" end="3:18.911">で</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">到更远的远方</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">甚至更遙遠的彼方</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Even further</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">и дальше за её пределы.</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt-BR">ainda mais longe</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">ancora più lontano</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Encore plus loin</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">und noch weiter</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es-419">mucho más allá</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es-ES">Mucho más allá</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ar">بل وأبعد من ذلك</span></p><p begin="3:19.088" end="3:21.499" itunes:key="L46" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:19.088" end="3:19.433">パー</span><span begin="3:19.433" end="3:19.736">ティー</span><span begin="3:19.736" end="3:20.054">を</span><span tts:ruby="container" amll:empty-beat="1"><span tts:ruby="base">続</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:20.054" end="3:20.248">つ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:20.248" end="3:20.734">ず</span></span></span><span begin="3:20.734" end="3:20.922">け</span><span begin="3:20.922" end="3:21.066">よ</span><span begin="3:21.066" end="3:21.385">う</span><span begin="3:21.385" end="3:21.425">、</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">让派对继续吧</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">讓派對繼續下去</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Let&apos;s keep the party going,</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">и пусть продолжается вечеринка.</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt-BR">Vamos seguir com a festa</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Continuiamo la festa,</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Continuons à faire la fête</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Wir feiern weiter</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es-419">Continuemos la fiesta,</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es-ES">Que siga la fiesta</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ar">لنُكمل الاحتفال،</span></p><p begin="3:21.667" end="3:27.655" itunes:key="L47" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">好</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:21.667" end="3:22.074">す</span></span></span><span begin="3:22.074" end="3:22.416">き</span><span begin="3:22.416" end="3:22.742">も</span><span tts:ruby="container" amll:empty-beat="1"><span tts:ruby="base">嫌</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:22.742" end="3:22.921">き</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:22.921" end="3:23.397">ら</span></span></span><span begin="3:23.397" end="3:23.596">い</span><span begin="3:23.596" end="3:23.945">も</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">超</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:23.945" end="3:24.375">こ</span></span></span><span begin="3:24.375" end="3:24.754">え</span><span begin="3:24.754" end="3:27.655">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">超越喜爱与厌恶</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">超越一切好惡</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Beyond love and hate</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Перешагнём любовь и ненависть</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt-BR">Superando o amor e o ódio</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">oltre ciò che amiamo e ciò che odiamo</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Au-delà de l&apos;amour et de la haine</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Lassen Liebe und Hass hinter uns</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es-419">más allá del amor y el odio</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es-ES">Más allá de gustos y disgustos</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ar">متجاوزين الحب والكراهية</span></p></div></body></tt>